sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as 平台管理员
    participant Controller as SystemController
    participant Service as SystemService
    participant Dao as SystemDao
    participant Filters as filters

    %% 操作日志查询
    Note over Admin, Filters: 操作日志查询
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"操作日志"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取操作日志列表
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 分页查询操作日志
    activate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 筛选条件:<br/>- operator: 操作人<br/>- operationType: 操作类型<br/>- targetType: 目标类型<br/>- operationTime: 时间范围<br/>- ipAddress: IP地址
    Dao-->>Service: 返回日志列表及总数
    deactivate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 操作日志记录:<br/>- 操作人ID/类型<br/>- 操作类型(CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE)<br/>- 目标类型/ID<br/>- 操作内容详情<br/>- IP地址/UserAgent<br/>- 操作时间
    Service->>Service: 格式化操作时间<br/>转换操作人名称
    Service-->>Controller: 返回日志列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示操作日志表格(时间/操作人/操作类型/目标/详情)
    deactivate Controller

    %% 操作日志详情查看
    Note over Admin, Filters: 操作日志详情查看
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"查看详情"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取操作日志详情
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询日志完整信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回日志详情(含请求参数/响应结果)
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Service: 格式化JSON参数(便于阅读)
    Service-->>Controller: 返回日志详情
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 弹窗展示日志详情(请求参数/响应结果/异常信息)
    deactivate Controller

    %% 审核日志查询
    Note over Admin, Filters: 审核日志查询
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"审核日志"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取审核日志
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 分页查询审核日志
    activate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 筛选条件:<br/>- auditor: 审核人<br/>- auditType: 审核类型(职位/企业/公告)<br/>- auditResult: 审核结果(通过/驳回)<br/>- auditTime: 审核时间范围
    Note right of Dao: 审核日志记录:<br/>- 审核人ID/名称<br/>- 审核类型<br/>- 目标ID/名称<br/>- 审核结果(APPROVED/REJECTED)<br/>- 驳回原因<br/>- 审核备注<br/>- 审核时间
    Dao-->>Service: 返回日志列表及总数
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 返回审核日志列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示审核日志表格(时间/审核人/类型/目标/结果/原因)
    deactivate Controller

    %% 审核日志详情查看
    Note over Admin, Filters: 审核日志详情查看
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"查看详情"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 查询审核日志详情
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询审核日志完整信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回日志详情
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 返回详情
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 弹窗展示审核详情(审核前后对比/驳回原因)
    deactivate Controller